From e9a111ceecfc52840a4227c82b8e49f1d0316192 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <226450061+logdog2325@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:03:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XD Netplay v1.6.0: remove the practice dummy; player-left
 logging without a gap

- The practice dummy (auto-played GBA port 3 for solo sparring) is gone on
  every platform: the GBA/PracticeDummy key, the netplay pin that forced it
  off, the SI input injection, the launcher checkbox, the Android switch and
  settings entry, and the boot line's practice_dummy field.
- NetPlayServer::OnDisconnect logs player-left through LogPostSession alone,
  which writes through the live sink while a session is open and appends
  otherwise, so no line can fall between IsSessionOpen and LogEvent.
- TimerWord/TimerSummary are static (they sit outside the file's anonymous
  namespace).
- XDNetplay::VERSION 1.6.0.
